Package: fabriconnect
Title: Read Microsoft Fabric Lakehouse Tables via OneLake
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Derick", "Imbati", email = "derick.imbati@aku.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = "CDIO, AKU")
Author: Derick Imbati [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Derick Imbati <derick.imbati@aku.edu>
Description: Provides functions to connect to Microsoft Fabric Lakehouses
    via the OneLake HTTPS API, bypassing the TDS/IP firewall bug.
    Uses Azure CLI or interactive device-code sign-in (email/MFA) for authentication and arrow for parquet reading.
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: arrow, utils, DBI, httr, jsonlite, odbc, processx
Suggests: duckdb, dplyr, callr, testthat, remotes
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8